  "description": "With maximum speed and minimum maintenance, the Vuca EVO Speed FSX 1 is ideal for commuters and frequent riders. Thanks to the revolutionary Pinion geared motor, which combines drive and gears, the result is an outstanding riding and speed experience with assistance up to 45 km/h. Combined with the low-maintenance belt drive, maintenance and wear are reduced to a minimum. At the same time, the Vuca with its full-suspension chassis and the new mono-link swing arm technology offers the best possible sporty comfort for daily journeys and long tours. With a battery capacity of up to 960 watt hours, the high-end S-Pedelec is also excellently positioned in terms of range. With further highlights such as the seat post that can be lowered at the touch of a button, high-quality Schwalbe Johnny Watts tyres and the particularly powerful Supernova lighting system, the Vuca EVO Speed FSX 1 makes no compromises.",
